WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.801 --> 00:00:02.836 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I watched the first
couple of episodes of this.

00:00:02.836 --> 00:00:04.537 align:start size:94% position:6%
It is right up my alley.
I really love it.

00:00:04.537 --> 00:00:06.072
You play the defense attorney --

00:00:06.072 --> 00:00:08.375
the real-life defense attorney
who defended the Menendezes.

00:00:08.375 --> 00:00:10.243 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Indeed, I do, yes.
-Leslie Abramson.

00:00:10.243 --> 00:00:13.580 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yes.
-But you did not meet her

00:00:13.580 --> 00:00:14.981 size:78% position:39%
personally, you never
spoke to her, right?

00:00:14.981 --> 00:00:17.851
-No, no, apparently she was
approached by the NBC people

00:00:17.851 --> 00:00:18.985 align:start size:94% position:6%
and she was not interested
in partaking.

00:00:18.985 --> 00:00:21.321
-Gotcha. But this was a trial

00:00:21.321 --> 00:00:23.156 align:start size:94% position:6%
that was very much
on television.

00:00:23.156 --> 00:00:24.924 size:81% position:41%
But you also play her,
as we saw in the clip,

00:00:24.924 --> 00:00:26.092 align:start size:94% position:6%
you sort of play
her private life.

00:00:26.092 --> 00:00:28.161
Do you feel a bit of freedom,

00:00:28.161 --> 00:00:30.163
not having met her, that you get
to make your own choices?

00:00:30.163 --> 00:00:32.132 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You know, I hate to say that,
but a little bit.

00:00:32.132 --> 00:00:34.501
Because the truth is nobody
knows what happened with her

00:00:34.501 --> 00:00:35.869 size:84% position:42%
alone with her husband.

00:00:35.869 --> 00:00:37.537 align:start size:94% position:6%
I guess that´s
up for conjecture.

00:00:37.537 --> 00:00:39.105 size:81% position:41%
But nobody that I know
knows what happened.

00:00:39.105 --> 00:00:41.875
And so there´s no way of knowing
beyond one´s imagination

00:00:41.875 --> 00:00:43.176 align:start size:94% position:6%
what that was like.

00:00:43.176 --> 00:00:45.278 align:start size:94% position:6%
So yeah, I guess it´s easier
than if she was there.

00:00:45.278 --> 00:00:46.513 align:start size:94% position:6%
It was like,
"That never happened."

00:00:46.513 --> 00:00:48.748 align:start size:94% position:6%
You know, so...
-This is better, yeah.

00:00:48.748 --> 00:00:50.150 align:start size:94% position:6%
You got the freedom of choice.
The one thing, though,

00:00:50.150 --> 00:00:51.351
that definitely happened,

00:00:51.351 --> 00:00:53.186 align:start size:94% position:6%
and I want to know
whether you enjoyed this,

00:00:53.186 --> 00:00:55.155
or you found this limiting.

00:00:55.155 --> 00:00:57.424 align:start size:94% position:6%
The wig that you have
in this show

00:00:57.424 --> 00:00:59.225
is really just one to remember.

00:00:59.225 --> 00:01:01.294 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Then there´s the wig.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:01.294 --> 00:01:04.464 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And that is -- I guess
that was hair in the ´90s.

00:01:04.464 --> 00:01:06.199 align:start size:94% position:6%
That was -- she didn´t walk in
and everybody said,

00:01:06.199 --> 00:01:07.500 align:start size:94% position:6%
"What´s going on
with your hair?"

00:01:07.500 --> 00:01:08.902 align:start size:94% position:6%
That was just a thing
a lot of people were doing.

00:01:08.902 --> 00:01:11.571 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Well, no. The truth is
that´s exactly what I wanted.

00:01:11.571 --> 00:01:13.506 align:start size:94% position:6%
I wish I had seen this picture
when it was the ´90s

00:01:13.506 --> 00:01:15.375 align:start size:94% position:6%
´cause I would have been
so frigging happy.

00:01:15.375 --> 00:01:17.677
I tried -- all the perms I got,

00:01:17.677 --> 00:01:19.546
how badly they turned out.

00:01:19.546 --> 00:01:21.281
-What went wrong with your perm?

00:01:21.281 --> 00:01:23.917 size:75% position:38%
-Well, often my hair
wasn´t long enough.

00:01:23.917 --> 00:01:26.252 align:start size:94% position:6%
You can´t get a perm
with short hair.

00:01:26.252 --> 00:01:28.721 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, oh -- they didn´t
tell you before they did it?

00:01:28.721 --> 00:01:31.191
-No, no.
But it´s what everybody wanted.

00:01:31.191 --> 00:01:33.693
And she, Leslie Abramson,
was born with this hair.

00:01:33.693 --> 00:01:35.929 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, really?
-And she hated it,

00:01:35.929 --> 00:01:37.530 align:start size:94% position:6%
from what I understand. It was
the bane of her existence.

00:01:37.530 --> 00:01:39.365 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You guys, should do like,
a "Gift of the Magi"

00:01:39.365 --> 00:01:40.800
where you trade hair somehow.

00:01:40.800 --> 00:01:42.068 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Light laughter ]

00:01:42.068 --> 00:01:43.970 size:78% position:39%
I don´t know what --
-Next year´s project.

00:01:43.970 --> 00:01:45.071 align:start size:94% position:6%
-[ Laughing ]
Next year´s project.

